                <pb facs="0547" n="485" sameAs="frus:frus1945v01/pg485"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">RSC Lot 60–D 224, Box 96: US Cr Min 22</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minutes of the Twenty-Second Meeting of the United
                        States Delegation, Held at San Francisco, Saturday, April 28, 1943, 9:30
                        a.m.</hi>
                </head>
                <dateline>
                    <placeName>San Francisco</placeName>, <date
                        ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-head" calendar="gregorian"
                        when="1943-04-28T09:30:00-07:00">April 28, 1943, 9:30 a.m.</date>
                </dateline>
                <p>[Here follows list of names of persons (42) present at meeting, and statements by
                    the delegates to the Advisers, announcement of schedule <pb facs="0548" n="486"
                        xml:id="pg486"/> of meetings, discussions regarding a memorandum on press
                    policy, report on work of the Conference, and anticipated study of the problem
                    of withdrawal.]</p>
            </div>
        </body>
